  "description": "A compressor insert for a track with a TRANSIENT mode: a soft-knee feed-forward compressor (threshold, ratio, attack, release) or a transient shaper (attack and sustain emphasis from a fast and a slow envelope follower), a make-up gain, a dry/wet mix, and a view of the transfer law. Stereo-capable (one linked gain). The Key parameter (OFF, T1..T16) makes it a sidechain compressor: the detector reads that track's level (COMP mode; TRANSIENT ignores it).",
